<section class="hero"><div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow">Get involved</span>
<h1>Help us reach the next 100 mothers.</h1>
<p class="lead">Give, volunteer, or spread the word. Every part of a kit, from the iron tablets to the handwritten card, depends on people like you.</p>
<div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="#donate">Donate</a><a class="btn ghost" href="#contact">Contact us</a></div>
</div></section>

<section class="alt ways" id="donate"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Ways to give</h2>
<p class="sub">About $7 covers one mother's kit: iron tablets for her pregnancy, two health guides in her language, and a handwritten card.</p>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><h3>Give online <span class="tag">Fastest</span></h3><p>A secure donation page. You can give once or monthly, and 100% of your gift reaches Heartlines International.</p><a class="btn primary" href="https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/donation-form/support-heartlines-international" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Donate online</a></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Give by check</h3><p>Make checks payable to &ldquo;Heartlines International.&rdquo; Email us for the mailing address.</p><a class="btn ghost" href="mailto:heartlinesinternational@gmail.com?subject=Giving%20by%20check">Email us</a></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Ask about a match</h3><p>Many employers match gifts. Employer matching opens once our 501(c)(3) status is confirmed.</p><a class="btn ghost" href="mailto:heartlinesinternational@gmail.com?subject=Employer%20matching">Ask us</a></div>
</div>
<p class="note" style="margin-top:22px">Our 501(c)(3) application is pending with the IRS.</p>
</div></section>

<section id="chipotle"><div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow">Sunday, November 8 &middot; 4&ndash;8 PM</span>
<h2>Chipotle fundraiser</h2>
<p class="sub">Chipotle, 1110 Blossom Hill Rd, Ste 30, San Jose. Chipotle gives 25% of our supporters' sales during the event to Heartlines International. Bring friends, family, your team, your club: every order helps.</p>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><h3>In the restaurant</h3><p>Before you pay, show the flyer on your phone or tell the cashier you're there for the Heartlines International fundraiser.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Order ahead for pickup</h3><p>In the Chipotle app or on chipotle.com, choose <strong>Pickup</strong> at the Blossom Hill Rd restaurant, then enter code <strong>RCTR9LP</strong> under &ldquo;Enter a Promo Code&rdquo; and tap Apply. Pick up between 4 and 8 PM on November 8.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>What doesn't count</h3><p>Delivery, orders through other apps, orders on other days or at other locations, and buying gift cards. Paying with a gift card you already have is fine.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="downloads">
<a class="dl" href="images/chipotle/flyer-en.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="images/chipotle/flyer-en.jpg" alt="Chipotle fundraiser flyer in English" loading="lazy"><span>Flyer (English, PDF)</span></a>
<a class="dl" href="images/chipotle/flyer-es.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="images/chipotle/flyer-es.jpg" alt="Chipotle fundraiser flyer in Spanish" loading="lazy"><span>Flyer (Espa&ntilde;ol, PDF)</span></a>
<a class="dl" href="images/chipotle/online-ordering-en.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="images/chipotle/online-ordering-en.jpg" alt="Chipotle guide to ordering online for a fundraiser" loading="lazy"><span>How to order online (PDF)</span></a>
<a class="dl" href="images/chipotle/online-ordering-es.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="images/chipotle/online-ordering-es.jpg" alt="Chipotle guide to ordering online for a fundraiser, in Spanish" loading="lazy"><span>C&oacute;mo ordenar en l&iacute;nea (PDF)</span></a>
</div>
<p class="note" style="margin-top:20px">Please share the flyer online and with people you know. Chipotle asks that flyers not be handed out to customers in or around the restaurant.</p>
</div></section>

