<section id="share"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Spread the word</h2>
<p class="sub">Most of our support comes from people telling people. Three easy ways to help:</p>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><h3>Share the flyer</h3><p>Post the Chipotle flyer to your story or send it to a group chat.</p><a class="btn ghost" href="images/chipotle/flyer-en.jpg" download="heartlines-chipotle-flyer.jpg">Save the image</a></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Follow and share</h3><p>Follow us on Instagram and share a post that means something to you.</p><a class="btn ghost" href="https://www.instagram.com/heartlinesinternational/">Instagram</a></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Bring a group</h3><p>Ask your club, team, or youth group to come to the fundraiser or write cards with us.</p><a class="btn ghost" href="mailto:heartlinesinternational@gmail.com?subject=Group%20volunteering">Email us</a></div>
</div>
</div></section>

